CLUB: ARIZONA OUTLAWS CONTEST CLUB
CREATED-BY: WA7BNM Web2Cabrillo 3.0.0
SOAPBOX: 5 Watts to a 20 Foot end-fed wire, thrown in a tree out my window.
SOAPBOX: Completed 126 QSOs in 37 Countries. I beat my last year # QSOs,
SOAPBOX: but even with more operating time I still had less Mults than last year.
SOAPBOX: 10m was the best band for me, with 30 Countries worked on 10m.
SOAPBOX: Europe was pretty weak Sat morning and still a bit weak Sunday.
SOAPBOX: I am surprised I had more contacts in Africa (8) than in Europe (6).
SOAPBOX: A really fun contest. One highlight was a 40m contact with China.
SOAPBOX: My "best DX" contact was St Helena. Many Island hoppers! TNX.
SOAPBOX: Thanks to all for your patience and the QSOs. Pure CW Fun!
SOAPBOX: GO ARIZONA OUTLAWS! -73- John N6HI
